# Without this, every `docker build` tarred `.env`, `data/`, `backups/` and `venv/` into the
# daemon's build context — secrets and a live database sent to the builder on every image build,
# regardless of what the Dockerfile's COPY lines actually reach. `*` excludes everything, then each
# `!` line re-admits exactly one of the Dockerfile's COPY sources — nothing else. det/image-
# completeness checks this list stays in step with the Dockerfile's own COPY lines.
*
!requirements.txt
!requirements.lock
!SparingHorse.py
!sh_engine.py
!sh_selftest.py
!sh_music.py
!test/golden/
!static/
!entrypoint.sh
